        "metadata": {
          "category": "podcast",
          "media": {
            "duration": 16182
          },
          "description": "Commemorating the 200th anniversary of Washington Irving’s “The Legend of Sleepy Hollow,” The Hollow is a modern take on the timeless story of Ichabod Crane and the Headless Horseman, perfect for families and kids over 10.\n\nWhen three 6th graders at Sleepy Hollow Middle School stumble upon a real-life ghost story, they find themselves on the trail of the Headless Horseman himself. Is he truly a terrifying ghoul, or has he been misunderstood for all these years?\n\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.",
